<title>UK: Man United year pre-tax profits down.</title>
<headline>Man United year pre-tax profits down.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.4		   vs 23.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.6		    vs 3.1</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.2		    vs 4.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     15.40		  vs 20.01</p>
<p> Turnover		   53.32		  vs 60.62</p>
<p> Operating result	 14.17		  vs 15.65</p>
<p> Exceptional		2.17		   vs nil</p>
<p> Tax			  4.13		   vs 5.79</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 2</p>
<p> Div registration date  Oct 22</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Oct 14</p>
<p>NOTE - Soccer club Manchester United Plc said the exceptional item arose from the sale of certain publishing interests to VCI Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom - +44 171 542 4019</p>
